$meta
  title = CRM-U
  description = CRM-U is a CRM for IT, VoIP and Internet service providers — accounts, contacts, leads and a configurable sales pipeline, plus a service book for the internet circuits, VoIP seats, SIP trunks, managed IT and hardware you provide, with recurring revenue (MRR/ARR), contract terms and renewal tracking, sites and assets with a map view, contract and document storage, a service desk with SLA clocks, an activity timeline, follow-up automation and reporting.
